  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/faec5027f67d49c7af3f271c478ef725/3D_Model_3ef90fcb-4113-439a-9dfb-e0d35631c03d.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a> <a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/debd6a6be9be4d068e4dd71169ef0730/Maker_s_Supply_Electronic_Kit_-_ZH038_Application_Instruction.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <svg class=\"download_svg\" fill=\"none\" height=\"65\" viewbox=\"0 0 65 65\" width=\"65\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M34.7087 0.802246L51.9921 16.7998V63.2344C51.9921 64.0948 51.2946 64.7922 50.4342 64.7922H2.24001C1.37961 64.7922 0.682129 64.0948 0.682129 63.2344V2.36012C0.682129 1.49973 1.37961 0.802246 2.24001 0.802246H34.7087Z\" fill=\"#2172D0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path> <path d=\"M2.89377 4.57204C2.89377 3.71164 3.59125 3.01416 4.45165 3.01416H33.4957C33.9151 3.01416 34.3168 3.18328 34.6099 3.48327L41.4271 10.46L49.2189 16.9423C49.5747 17.2383 49.7804 17.6771 49.7804 18.1399V61.023C49.7804 61.8834 49.083 62.5809 48.2226 62.5809H4.45164C3.59125 62.5809 2.89377 61.8834 2.89377 61.023V4.57204Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> <path d=\"M34.6774 18.3479H51.9922L33.1196 0.802246V16.79C33.1196 17.6504 33.8171 18.3479 34.6774 18.3479Z\" fill=\"#2172D0\"></path> <rect fill=\"#2172D0\" height=\"2.99978\" width=\"9.99928\" x=\"8.99524\" y=\"16.801\"></rect> <rect fill=\"#2172D0\" height=\"2.99978\" width=\"9.99928\" x=\"8.99524\" y=\"34.7998\"></rect> <rect fill=\"#2172D0\" height=\"2.99978\" width=\"23.9983\" x=\"8.99524\" y=\"25.8005\"></rect> <circle cx=\"44.9022\" cy=\"44.7086\" fill=\"white\" r=\"10.7622\" stroke=\"#2172D0\" stroke-width=\"2.47381\" transform=\"rotate(-49.859 44.9022 44.7086)\"></circle> <path d=\"M60.723 60.9036C61.7674 61.7844 63.3281 61.6517 64.2089 60.6073C65.0897 59.5628 64.957 58.0021 63.9126 57.1214L60.723 60.9036ZM52.2213 53.7341L60.723 60.9036L63.9126 57.1214L55.4109 49.9519L52.2213 53.7341Z\" fill=\"#2172D0\"></path> </svg><span>Application instructions</span> </a></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<!-- 文案布局 --> <!-- Overview -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\nThe Maker's Supply Electronics Bundle consists of a <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/power-distribution-board-pdb-4-channels?skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Power Distribution Board - 4 Channels (1PCS)</strong></span></a>, <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/self-locking-button-switch-with-sh1-0-connector?_pos=1&amp;_sid=b62daa09b&amp;_ss=r&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Self-Locking Button Switch (2PCS)</strong></span></a>, <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/potentiometer-board-with-sh1-0-connector?_pos=1&amp;_sid=cb973e388&amp;_ss=r&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Potentiometer Board with SH1.0 Connector (2PCS)</span></strong></a>, and includes <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/usb-a-power-cable-with-ph2-0-connector?id=41588968882291&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">USB-A Power Cable</span></strong></a> with complete wiring accessories <span style=\"color: #000000;\">(<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/jumper-cable-with-sh1-0-connector?id=41588992999539&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Jumper Cable</strong></span></a>)</span>. Featuring standard SH1.0/PH2.0 connectors between modules, it supports various applications such as LED dimming, motor speed control, and voltage regulation, offering simple operation and easy connectivity.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Application</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\"><!-- 文本模块 -->\n<ul>\n<li><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">LED Dimming Controller: </strong>A dual-channel LED strip control system with independent switching and brightness adjustment, suitable for various lighting scenarios</li>\n<li><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">DC Motor Speed Controller: </strong>Dual-channel stepless speed control system with precise start/stop and speed regulation for two motors, ideal for mechanical power applications</li>\n<li><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Adjustable Power Supply: </strong>Protected dual-channel adjustable power solution with variable voltage output, perfect for electronic experiments and testing scenarios</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- 文本模块 结尾--></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pctpct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Example of a module using this kit (includes other Maker's Supply parts)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white anim